### Test du middleware d'erreur - Validation
### Ces requêtes vont déclencher des erreurs au format standardisé 422

### POST Author sans firstName (champ requis)
POST http://localhost:3000/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Test bio"
}

###

### POST Author avec firstName trop court
POST http://localhost:3000/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "A",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "bio": "Bio de test"
} 

###

### POST Author avec date future (birthDate invalide)
POST http://localhost:3000/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe", 
  "bio": "Bio de test",
  "birthDate": "2030-01-01"
}

###

### POST Book sans titre (champ requis)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "synopsis": "Un synopsis sans titre ni date"
}

###

### POST User avec mot de passe trop court
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "123"
}

###

### POST Category sans nom (champ requis)
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Description sans nom"
}

###
